Z||000003||286SE'S||09-24-2001||03:33 PM||||I tried some from a 6000STE and they had the same bolt pattern. Fit perfect, same tan color and wider (more comfortable) and even had chrome trim at the top where the single bolt attaches it but..<BR>they hit the seats because they were a little wider. Hard to get the seatbelt on with the door closed and I eventually took them off for that reason.<BR>I took them off the car at the junkyard and went to the stripped Fiero and tested the fit before I bought them.<BR>Terry||||reg||1
